So yet another healer on his desperate try to find glory and honor deep
down in the dungeons.  He left his home equipped with little more than
his stethoscope; no gifts had been under the christmas tree for him.
Well, he thought, a mail demon might come along to deliver best wishes,
perhaps, or I find some helpful tools myself.

On level two he gathered some tool in a corner, the first one he found.
Fine, he said, I'll take it with me and consider it my christmas present.
But what is it - a stethoscope ??  I already have one !  Disappointed he
descended to level three.  Turning around a corner he nearly stumbled
and got entangled by another tool, his second tool in the dungeons of
doom.  And guess what - another stethoscope !

Now experience level 4 and dungeon level 3 and no other tools but already
*three* stethoscopes.  Someone is making fun of him.

I suppose The Wizards sarcasm is manifesting that way ?!

